{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：12:47 2026-11-26 HKT<br/>發佈時間：12:47 2026-11-26 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：12:47 2026-11-26 HKT</p><img alt=\"西灣河華昇大廈平台戶銀主盤 低銀行估價約46%\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cf990d0c5e95bf564e65fe7b6ba81b4c/2026-11/SAI1.png\"/><p>西灣河華昇大廈低層連平台特色單位，面積285方呎，1房間隔，外連625方呎平台，原業主早於2008年斥資186萬元購入，現已淪為銀主盤，開拍價250萬元，較銀行估價低出約215萬元，或約46%，呎價約8,772元，將於12月9日拍賣。</p><h3>華昇大廈低層連平台特色戶：</h3><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2019cdcf5198d82bf763b2a2e9782885/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_11_44_45_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f2d2436c4e20b06cd01eeb3b26e958d7/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_11_44_46_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c99282a2d98e405e34d7380887bd41f5/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_11_44_46.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ed7b5262ca751cab072d630aa3cdf41a/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_11_44_45_3_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bdc90e6f2b45e1ed27f713da03403211/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_11_44_45_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/96a03b0532d14d7f5108669fd3149194/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_11_44_44_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1810d7a55db2e6b96be731dd94af1750/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_11_44_45.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ded6d4e082d612ec6a552c3d0db528ed/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_11_44_44_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8f3d1266cd79fd6ec0da5b483b6693ce/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_11_44_44.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7b525a278a32a2d8b3e264a8ecd4879c/2026-11/SAI2.jpg\"/><p>據市場消息指，該單位屬首次推出拍賣，由於原業主未能償還欠款而遭銀主收回物業，惟所欠款項不多，因而銀主定價上彈性較大，以低價開拍吸客。</p><p>相關文章：</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T05:01:00.100629+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":287,"images":11,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T04:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T05:14:32.802801+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T04:54:22.698445+00:00","content_hash":"7cc2ef74835bf1616fdea02a85486fa7e7ec4510f396ad4d88ced94435e649c4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}